    rcap:evidencePosition "4" ;
    rcap:evidenceSection "8.3.4" ;
    rcap:evidenceText "Cease antibiotics when there is evidence of sufficient clinical improvement, no microbiological diagnosis has been made and no clinical evidence of deep infection (e.g. empyema or lung abscess). The duration of antibiotic therapy will be decided by the treating clinician and local guidelines." ;
    rcap:occurrenceKind "intervention" .

